message: "If you use this code, data, or results, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this repository."
title: "The Radius Valley's Age Evolution Around M Dwarfs: An Inconclusive Verdict and a Quantified Path Forward"
authors:
  - family-names: Shaad
    given-names: Zubayer Hasan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-2322-8553"
  - name: "The Radius Valley Age Evolution Collaboration"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zabdax/radius-valley-age-evolution"
abstract: "A calibrated statistical gate (null- and signal-injected Monte Carlo ensembles) applied to the FGK radius-valley age-evolution control and the M-dwarf regime, with a 15-cell power grid quantifying the sample size and age-precision requirements for resolution."
keywords:
  - exoplanets
  - radius valley
  - M dwarf stars
  - astrostatistics
